message: "If you use this benchmark or code, please cite the manuscript and this archived release."
title: "DSAL-Egov: reproducibility package for a domain-specific abstraction layer for cross-chain e-government interoperability"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
type: software
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ywzqwwt/dsal-egov"
abstract: >-
  Synthetic DSAL-Egov Concept Benchmark v1 (5,400 concept-mapping pairs over
  Hyperledger Fabric, FISCO BCOS and Corda), a deterministic benchmark
  generator, the two-stage retrieval-and-reranking reference implementation,
  the evaluation harness and recorded results, the manuscript figure scripts,
  and the TLA+ coordination model with its TLC model-checking log. All content
  is synthetic or derived from public platform documentation; no agency,
  employer or person-level data are included.
